{"Potential crash if `self.host` is nil - the `sub!` method will raise NoMethodError on nil, need to add nil check: `self.host.sub!(/^https?:\\/\\//, '') if self.host.present?`": 0.8625791668891907, "Missing nil check before calling `destroy` in embeddable_hosts_controller - if no host with given ID exists, `host` will be nil and raise NoMethodError": 0.8042030930519104, "Security risk with case-insensitive host matching - without a unique index on `LOWER(host)`, duplicate hosts with different casing can be created (e.g., 'Example.com' and 'example.com'), leading to ambiguous authorization checks": 0.24596813321113586, "SQL Injection vulnerability - variable `h` (host from site settings) is directly interpolated into SQL without escaping, allowing arbitrary SQL execution if site_settings contains malicious SQL": 0.894720733165741, "Category lookup query will fail if no matching category is found - returns empty result set causing `[0]['id']` to raise an error, needs error handling for when no category is found": 0.9545555114746094, "Missing nil check in update action - if embeddable host doesn't exist, `host` will be nil and calling `save_host(nil)` will cause errors": 0.6968977451324463, "Breaking behavioral change when `eh` is nil - `eh.try(:category_id)` returns nil and topic will be created without a category, unlike previous implementation which always used `SiteSetting.embed_category`": 0.7430517077445984}